<title>{{name}}</title>

<h1>{{name}}</h1>
<p>A new Rust-kit app. Each page below shows one part of the framework.</p>

<Card title="This page">
  <p>Prerendered at build time from <code>src/routes/index.rk</code>. It has no state and no handlers, so it ships no JavaScript.</p>
